    "text": "1 days ago MESQUITE, Texas — Drivers in Mesquite and eastern Dallas County should plan ahead this week as a series of nightly closures along I-635 and U.S. 80 continue through early Monday morning, April 13. The work began Monday night, April 6, and is part of a much larger interchange reconstruction... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
